Source: perl5-mt
Section: interpreters
Priority: optional
Maintainer: perl5-mt packagers <maintainers@perl5-mt.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13), build-essential
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: perl5-mt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-threaded Perl 5 interpreter with frozen images and SIMD
 perl5-mt is a multi-threaded Perl 5.40.2 runtime installed under /opt/perl5-mt
 providing immutable frozen boot images, per-worker interpreter compartments,
 cooperative fibers, deterministic numerics, and portable SIMD acceleration.
